r individual clients in India and internationally. The company's product portfolio includes HyperStock, a share broker accounting software; commodities broker back office accounting software; HyperCase, a stockbroker legal case management solution; portfolio management software; payroll HRMS solution; HyperSoft, a newspaper publishing software; Flat Account for co-operative housing society account maintenance; Manufacturing ERP, an integrated manufacturing management software; F.A.S.T, a fixed asset management and tracking software; B P M S, a budgetary planning and monitoring system; KYC for digital record management; and Hyper-KOT, a restaurant management system.It also offers IT consulting services on Web and client-server products; database services; project consultancy on Gupta/Centura: SQLWindows/SQLBase applications; and maintenance and conversion of legacy application software, as well as offshore project consultancy and development. In addition, the company provides application development, business integration, and application maintenance services; various IT programming services; offshore IT services; and BPO service. Further, the company offers legacy system migration services, including requirements specification, design, development, and data conversion services. Additionally, it provides project and product lifecycle management; client/server application development; web application development; and ERP services, as well as manages on-site teams. HyperSoft Technologies Limited was incorporated in 1983 and is based in Hyderabad, India."}}